        "doc": "SOA predicts the label whose side has higher Ldim.",
        "is_root": false,
        "kind": "theorem",
        "pretty": "∀ {X : Type} (C : ConceptClass X Bool) (history : List (X × Bool)) (x : X),\n  have V := versionSpace C history;\n  have b := (SOA X C).predict history x;\n  LittlestoneDim X {c | c ∈ V ∧ c x = b} ≥ LittlestoneDim X {c | c ∈ V ∧ c x = !b}",
        "topo": 8,
        "type_sha256": "84754460ed4d72cd14109498d4ac516a0a2bca67256e08a7bea98cc0d378f263"
      },
      {
